          "guid": "mss9kt5qof6o8f1f",
          "message": {
            "text": "The trace asks each stage independently instead of inferring a route from the final face. That separation is load-bearing on Windows: a hardcoded candidate that is installed but uncovered must fall through to MapCharacters, whose base is still the literal first CSS family even when that family was absent from the declared-family walk.",
            "markdown": "The trace asks each stage independently instead of inferring a route from the final face. That separation is load-bearing on Windows: a hardcoded candidate that is installed but uncovered must fall through to `MapCharacters`, whose base is still the literal first CSS family even when that family was absent from the declared-family walk."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
