          "message": {
            "text": "The exact-block trace joins assignment and representation instead of leaving two plausible green artifacts. Each cell now records ordered declared-family evidence, the selected mechanism and physical face, HarfBuzz glyph id/cluster, that gid’s raster kind, and the final raster span; a rerun can therefore distinguish cmap14/fallback drift from a correct face whose paint ownership was lost.",
            "markdown": "The exact-block trace joins assignment and representation instead of leaving two plausible green artifacts. Each cell now records ordered declared-family evidence, the selected mechanism and physical face, HarfBuzz glyph id/cluster, that gid’s raster kind, and the final raster span; a rerun can therefore distinguish cmap14/fallback drift from a correct face whose paint ownership was lost."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
